{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAxLS0yMDEwL0Rvc3RpJTIwRnJpZW5kcyUyMEZvcmV2ZXIlMjAlMjgyMDA1JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Dosti Friends Forever","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/FsbAjOevHYDjU7eXFFXS8aveWy.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xFCaYdVcRmeftt50HBclL0OCZDC.jpg","description":"Karan (Bobby Deol) was wealthy and a mansion was his habitat. Raj (Akshay Kumar) had empty pockets and the sky was his roof. Karan's jet ensured that he could fly if he wanted. Raj could only depend on his two feet. Karan had a family and yet craved love. Raj had love to share, but craved a family. Karan was the eternal Casanova. Raj was the proverbial one-woman man. Karan had it all, and yet felt empty. Raj had nothing, but his heart was full. They were two people as different as can be. Yet they found a common ground. One that led to the glorious road of Friendship! But can they sustain their friendship when new conflicts arise?\n\nReleased 23 Dec 2005 · India, South Africa · Language: Hindi · 142 min\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi","releaseInfo":"2005","genres":["Romance","Drama","Bollywood"],"imdbRating":"4.4","runtime":"142 min","cast":["Akshay Kumar","Bobby Deol","Kareena Kapoor Khan","Lara Dutta","Juhi Chawla Mehta","Shakti Kapoor","Kiran Kumar","Mahesh Thakur"],"director":["Suneel Darshan"],"released":"2005-12-23T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Friends forever","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Suneel Darshan","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tLXY2rvg4VBo47sbFQbHkqtntbl.jpg"},{"name":"Akshay Kumar","character":"Raj Malhotra","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sR8nASRtTpiwXqkFHjG2jdRBZ7a.jpg"},{"name":"Bobby Deol","character":"Karan Thapar","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2npVa3PduichY8e7qBiE54m9VVP.jpg"},{"name":"Kareena Kapoor Khan","character":"Anjali","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kp9xnwDALUt6nuPBGuJHlvnxGnM.jpg"},{"name":"Lara Dutta","character":"Ka